  "body": "Create the home you've always imagined on this generous and elevated 543sqm freehold section, perfectly positioned to embrace Long Bay's sought-after coastal lifestyle. Whether you're planning a home tailored to your family or exploring an investment opportunity, this is an exciting canvas for your next chapter.\r\n\r\nJust minutes from Long Bay Village, the beach and regional park, enjoy cafes, shops and everyday amenities alongside beautiful green spaces and coastal walks. With excellent local schools, including Long Bay College and Long Bay Primary, and a welcoming family community, this location offers the ideal balance of convenience, recreation and seaside living.\r\n\r\nBring your vision to life and secure your place in this thriving coastal neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nConjunctional offers welcomed!\r\nUse this link to view property files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/5YB1",
